  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Northern Plains, Hei Lou Lan fights Yin Wu Que. She has seen through his waxing crescent moon tactic, and she charges while he delays and retreats. Hei Lou Lan shouts. Her body flickers, eight figures fly out, and they encircle Yin Wu Que. He is caught unguarded and surrounded. His expression turns pale.",
      "chapters": [
        2169
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_yin_wu_que"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The dark capital strength biao is already fighting with Hei Lou Lan, attacking from the left and right and suppressing Chu Du. Hei Lou Lan shouts that Chu Du will lose and unleashes this killer move. Chu Du is surrounded by countless figures and cannot break out for the time being. A shadow then casts down from above him. It is the dark capital strength biao, which opens its mouth to bite.",
